insert into public.cpl_memory (slug,kind,title,summary,tags,status,source,verified_by,verified_at,author,event_date) values
('d-joined-course-keeps-the-mid-row-2026-11-20','decision','A course joined to a catalog M-ID leaves that M-ID''s row as it stands','S694 (SkyPetrel), 2026-11-20: a course assigned or re-homed onto a catalog M-ID leaves that M-ID''s row as it stands; its course count and units range grow. Where the target has its own record, a joined course does not vote on credit status, units, TOP or confidence; the member list keeps each control number. His to revise. Built in PR 3618.',array['commons','m-id','assign','build','decide-and-record'],'proposed','PR 3618 (810a9b50); kb/_assign_from_panel_dryrun.py',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('d-assign-first-slice-existing-only-2026-11-20','decision','Assign''s first slice targets existing M-IDs only','S694, 2026-11-20: Assign from the panel first assigns a pile course to an M-ID that exists (one of its three closest, or one typed by id). Propose a new M-ID waits on the pile mint, because the promote step holds a one-course placeholder. His to revise.',array['commons','m-id','assign','decide-and-record'],'proposed','PR 3622; docs/reference/lanes/commons.md',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('d-assign-never-replaces-a-row-2026-11-21','decision','Assign writes one kb_curation row, insert only, and never replaces one','S694, 2026-11-21: the Assign control writes one kb_curation row, CN:<control number> merge_into, insert only (resolution=ignore-duplicates after reading that one key), so it never replaces a curator''s row. A failed read of assigned courses offers no Assign; Take it back names course, field and value. His to revise. PR 3622, 35 checks.',array['commons','m-id','assign','kb_curation','decide-and-record'],'proposed','PR 3622; tests/coci_list_assign.test.js',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('d-links-count-through-folds-2026-11-20','decision','The pile''s exhibit links count through the build''s folds, at Strong or Possible only','S694, 2026-11-20: the pile sorts by the exhibit links of each row''s closest M-ID, counted through consolidated_from, routed_from and merge_into as the build folds them, and only where the closest M-ID is a Strong or Possible match. His to revise. Built in PR 3619 (tests/closest_mid_links_test.py).',array['commons','m-id','exhibits','closest-mid','decide-and-record'],'proposed','PR 3619 (e04e155d)',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('d-topics-not-applicable-2026-11-20','decision','Special and selected topics to be flagged not applicable, as independent study is','S694, 2026-11-20: special and selected topics courses (584 in the Needs an M-ID pile) are to be flagged not applicable, as independent study is, under the flag-and-hide rule. Planned, not built; told to Sam in session, no answer yet. His to revise.',array['commons','m-id','flags','topics','decide-and-record'],'proposed','docs/reference/lanes/commons.md (PR 3622''s NEXT 2); S694 session',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('d-pile-mint-first-wave-scope-2026-11-20','decision','The pile mint''s first wave: 1,602 courses','S694, 2026-11-20: the first mint wave over the Needs an M-ID pile is 1,602 courses; it leaves out the 372 with a Strong or Possible match (Assign''s), 502 topics courses and 32 shared control numbers. The plan mints only where a route gives a SUBJ4. His to revise. Plan kb/pile_mint_out/2026-11-21/plan.json (PR 3621).',array['commons','m-id','mint','pile','decide-and-record'],'proposed','PR 3621 (ab0ed744); kb/_pile_mint_dryrun.py',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('f-assign-build-dryrun-measured-2026-11-20','fact','The Assign build change, measured unchanged to changed','S694, 2026-11-20, kb/_assign_from_panel_dryrun.py: pile courses listing under their target 70 of 82 to 82 of 82; a minted course with subject, credit status and TOP 0 of 12 to 12 of 12. Today''s output moved in three places: 15 held courses list under their M-IDs (member rows 134,485 to 134,500; pile 2,508 to 2,493), two units figures (AUTO M9004, CULN M1032), FIRE M1219 on its own row (12).',array['commons','m-id','assign','measured'],'proposed','kb/assign_dryrun_out/2026-11-20/ (PR 3618)',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('f-pile-is-generic-shell-titles-2026-11-20','fact','Why the Needs an M-ID pile exists: 2,364 of 2,508 are generic-shell titles','S694, 2026-11-20: 2,364 of the 2,508 pile courses carry a title the identity seed''s STOP_PATTERNS set aside as a generic shell (special or selected topics 584, practicum 571, tutoring 266, field work and the like 240, seminar 222, apprenticeship 169); 119 a title its CODE_RE read as code-only; 19 are ordinary.',array['commons','m-id','pile','measured'],'proposed','S694 measurement over kb/coci_closest_mid.json and the identity seed',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('f-exhibit-links-through-folds-2026-11-20','fact','Exhibit links reach the catalog mostly through folds','S694, 2026-11-20: of 4,591 records in kb/coci_articulations.json, 3,101 sit on a live id, 413 reach a row through consolidated_from, 12 through routed_from, 971 through merge_into; 91 records on 66 ids reach nothing. Group Communication''s 67 land on COMM 140, which no pile course names; 23 pile rows'' first recommendation carries a link; 4 pile courses are named by an exhibit directly.',array['commons','m-id','exhibits','measured'],'proposed','PR 3619; tests/closest_mid_links_test.py',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('f-pile-mint-plan-measured-2026-11-21','fact','The pile mint plan: 572 records planned, 944 courses held for want of a SUBJ4','S694, plan of 2026-11-21: 58 catalog records holding 140 courses and 514 stand-alone records planned; 944 held because no route gives a SUBJ4 (the subject map decides 657; the two new routes pass the 98% self-recall floor only at 50 and 100 unanimous votes); 4 held for Assign. The subject map disagrees with the identity file''s SUBJ4 for 6,545 of 51,616 courses (13%).',array['commons','m-id','mint','measured'],'proposed','kb/pile_mint_out/2026-11-21/plan.json (PR 3621)',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('f-subjects-card-measured-2026-11-21','fact','The Subjects card''s first count: 16 colleges, 1,431 college-and-code pairs','S694, 2026-11-21: the Subjects card reads 16 colleges, 17,341 courses, 1,431 college-and-code pairs, 746 with a printed name at 10 colleges; 1,339 codes on both the catalog and the state list, 92 catalog only, 194 state list only; 753 of 1,625 codes get a common subject code from the existing files. Its builder is not in the daily build yet.',array['commons','subjects','common-subjects-reference','measured'],'proposed','PR 3620; kb/status/local_subject_titles.json',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('p-kill-check-parent-and-start-2026-11-21','pitfall','A conductor killed a worker''s test run, taking it for its own','S694, 2026-11-21: the conductor killed a worker''s npm test by process id, mistaking it for its own run. Before a kill, check the process''s parent and its start time, and kill only what this session started.',array['agents','tooling','conductor','pitfall'],'proposed','S694 session transcript, 2026-11-21',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('p-stacked-branch-after-squash-2026-11-21','pitfall','A branch stacked on a PR that squash-merges conflicts on every shared file','S694, 2026-11-21: a branch built on top of another PR''s branch conflicted on every shared file once that PR squash-merged, because the squash commit is new history. Rebuild such a branch as cherry-picks of its own commits on main.',array['git','branches','tooling','pitfall'],'proposed','S694 session transcript, 2026-11-21',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('p-failed-read-is-not-empty-2026-11-21','pitfall','A failed read passed as an empty list where a write depends on it','S694, 2026-11-21: the second reader''s BLOCKING finding on the Assign control (PR 3622): a failed read of assigned courses was passed on as none assigned, so the panel would offer a write it could not check. A failed read must be its own state; the control now offers no Assign when the read fails.',array['commons','assign','second-read','pitfall'],'proposed','PR 3622 (the second read)',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('p-fingerprint-raw-bytes-daily-stamps-2026-11-20','pitfall','A fingerprint over raw bytes never matches when inputs carry daily stamps','S694, 2026-11-20: the reader on PR 3619 found that the closest M-ID rebuild''s input fingerprint, taken over raw bytes, would never match, because its inputs carry a daily stamp; the rebuild would run every day. Fingerprint the content that decides the output.',array['daily-build','fingerprint','second-read','pitfall'],'proposed','PR 3619 (the second read)',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-20'),
('p-four-suites-four-cores-2026-11-21','pitfall','Four test suites at once on four cores made every suite slow','S694, 2026-11-21: four workers ran their test suites at once on a four-core machine, and every suite ran slow enough to stall the merges. Run one or two suites at a time.',array['tests','agents','tooling','pitfall'],'proposed','S694 session transcript, 2026-11-21',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('m-assign-build-and-pile-links-merged-2026-11-21','milestone','Assign''s build, the pile''s links and the mint plan merged','S694, 2026-11-20 to 21: PR 3618 (810a9b50, the build for Assign from the panel), PR 3619 (e04e155d, the pile sorted by exhibit links through the folds; kb/coci_closest_mid.json rebuilt in the daily build) and PR 3621 (ab0ed744, the pile mint dry run, nothing applied) merged; PR 3617 (1f7135da) compacted the commons lane.',array['commons','m-id','assign','milestone'],'proposed','PRs 3617, 3618, 3619, 3621',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21'),
('m-subjects-card-and-assign-control-2026-11-21','milestone','The Subjects card and the Assign control built','S694, 2026-11-21: PR 3620 (the Subjects card on the Commons front, #commons/subjects) and PR 3622 (the Assign control in the Courses List panel, after a second read held it) were built; both were open with CI running when this row was written, for the conductor to merge on green.',array['commons','subjects','assign','milestone'],'proposed','PRs 3620, 3622',null,null,'SkyPetrel (S694)','2026-11-21')
